  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit of yours that has this ability gets:\n\n- **[Feel No Pain 3+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** versus psychic attacks.\n- **Psychic Null (Aura)**: any friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit within 6\" of it gets **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** versus psychic attacks.\n\nYour army can contain **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units although **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** is not one of their faction keywords. Unless a rule says otherwise, **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** can't be chosen as your army faction, and no **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** model can be your **WARLORD**.",
